# ⛔ AND ANY RENAMED OR ARCHIVED COPY (2026-09-03). "configs/" alone did not
# cover configs-STALE-<date>/, so setting the old folder aside and running
# git add -A committed eleven personal configs -- three carrying a real
# controller MAC -- to a public repo.
configs*/


# Generated by build.ps1 from tools/controller-config-test-client.html.
# Regenerated every build, so it never wants committing.
src/app/ui_page_generated.inl
# The previous 20 MB of device.log, kept by the log cap (src/log/capped_log.inl).
device.log.1

